八、1.1.3 稳定性及独立来源（2026-10-07）
---------------------------------------
分类目录改为独立限时请求，避免漫画页阻塞后续分类；图文漫画明确标注不支持视频。
混合编码分集合并前逐集标准化；硬件编码失败可整轮回退软件编码。
新增西饭独立来源，保留服务端锁定状态，不请求解锁或广告奖励接口。
来源接口参考 Hululu007/drpy-node 的接口路径与公开返回结构，适配器独立编写。
Mac FFmpeg 改为固定 FFmpeg 9.0.2 与 x264 b35605a 自行源码构建。

2026-10-07 (1.1.5): Added all-source search across Hongguo, Xifan and Hema.
The independently implemented Hema adapter reads publicly available search and
episode metadata from www.kuaikaw.cn, preserves charged/unknown episodes as locked,
and does not request unlock or encrypted-media endpoints. No third-party adapter
code was copied. Content rights remain with their respective owners.

